{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06275","headline":"卢姬篇 · 崔颢","name":"卢姬篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢姬少小魏王家，绿鬓红唇桃李花。\n魏王绮楼十二重，水晶帘箔绣芙蓉。\n白玉栏干金作柱，楼上朝朝学歌舞。\n前堂後堂罗袖人，南窗北窗花发春。\n翠幌珠帘鬬丝管，一弹一奏云欲断。\n君王日晚下朝归，鸣环佩玉生光辉。\n人生今日得娇贵，谁道卢姬身细微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}